    {
      "id": "1fb7e4c7",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Постановка задачи"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "421d8210",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Нас интересует фильтрация зашумлённых измерений объекта управления, который задан передаточной функией при помощи фильтра Калмана."
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a43a3423",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Определим коэффициент усиления фильтра Калмана с использованием библиотеки [`ControlSystems.jl`](https://juliacontrol.github.io/ControlSystems.jl/stable/) и интегрируем **Julia** код, реализующий фильтр, в модель **Engee** с использованием блока **Engee Function**."
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "83f1067b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Для реализации фильтра Калмана нам нужна модель в пространстве состояний."
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b04af4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "$$\\dot{x} = \\begin{bmatrix} \\dot{x}_1 \\\\ \\dot{x}_2 \\end{bmatrix} = Ax + Bu$$\r\n$$y = Cx + Du$$"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "48776926",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Тогда матрицы пространства состояний будут определяться следующим образом:"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c18fc3d3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "$$A = \\begin{bmatrix} a_{11} & a_{12} \\\\ a_{21} & a_{22} \\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$B = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ b_{21} \\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$C = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n$$D = 0\n$$\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e07e3c8a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Фильтрация сигнала в Engee с использованием блока Engee Function"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4a5cf133",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Анализ модели"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8dc3f45",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Объект представлен передаточной функцией:"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1e357f75",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "$$W = \\frac{2}{25s^2 + s + 1}\n$$\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ef17274b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Блоками **Band-Limited White Noise** `ProcessNoise` и `MeasurementNoise`  представлены внешнее воздействие и шум измерений."
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "43e5e23b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Подсистема `Kalman Filter`:"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "57f64b38",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "![ef_2.PNG](attachment:ef_2.PNG)"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "ef_2.PNG": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7d3dd48a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Размерность входных и выходных сигналов определяется свойством **Size**:\r\n\r\n* на вход блока подаётся два скалярных сигнала и вектор `[2x1]`;\r\n* на выходе формируется один вектор `[2x1]`. "
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3220c12f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Параметрам `KF_A`, `KF_B`, `KF_C`, `KF_D`, `KF_K` сопоставляются переменные `A`, `B`, `C`, `D` и `K` из рабочей области **Engee**. Их значения будут определены в разделе **\"Запуск симуляции\"**."
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "908d3a0e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Содержимое вкладки **ExeCode**  блока `KF`: "
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "63a7cdbf",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```julia\r\ninclude(\"/user/start/examples/base_simulation/juliacodeintegration/filter.jl\")\r\n\r\nstruct KF <: AbstractCausalComponent; end\r\n\r\nfunction (kalman_filter::KF)(t::Real, u, y, x)\r\n    xhat = xhat_predict(u, x, KF_A, KF_B) + xhat_update(u, y, x, KF_C, KF_D, KF_K)\r\n\r\n    return xhat\r\nend\r\n```"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c8bbb29b",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Структура `KF` наследуется от `AbstractCausalComponent`."
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "305107b4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "В файле `KalmanFilterFunction.jl` определяются функции `xhat_predict` и `xhat_update`, предназначенные для формирования выходного сигнала `xhat` блока `KF`:"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ea437af6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "```julia\r\nfunction xhat_predict(u, x, A, B)\r\n    return (B * u) + (A * x)\r\nend\r\n\r\nfunction xhat_update(u, y, x, C, D, K)\r\n    return (K * (y .- ((C * x) .+ (D * u))))\r\nend\r\n```"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "134faee2",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "В данном примере внутренние состояния отсутствуют, поэтому метод `update!`, предназначенный для их обновления, отсутствует."
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9ea40f00",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Запуск симуляции"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "88c63062",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Загрузим модель `juliaCodeIntegration.engee`:"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5f45d440",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "exampleKalmanFilter = engee.load(\"$demoroot/exampleKalmanFilter.engee\", force = true)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": "Model(\n    name: exampleKalmanFilter,\n    id: 92e19d64-dfcd-496e-b11a-a3802d21c8c9\n)"
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "execution_count": 104
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6b45a8de",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "И инициализируем переменные, необходимые для её симуляции:"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "de4d57b1",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "Ts = 0.001;\r\nQ = 1e-2;\r\nR = 1e-2;\r\n\r\nprocessNoisePower = Q * Ts;\r\nmeasurementNoisePower = R * Ts;"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aa68fcd5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Сформируем модель в пространстве состояний с использованием функции [`ss`](https://juliacontrol.github.io/ControlSystems.jl/stable/lib/constructors/#ControlSystemsBase.ss) из библиотеки [`ControlSystems.jl`](https://juliacontrol.github.io/ControlSystems.jl/stable/):"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a18213e4",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import EngeeDSP.Functions: tf2ss\n\nK = 2\nT = 3\ndzeta = 0.1\n\nb = [K]\na = [T^2, 2*T*dzeta, 1]\n\nA, B, C, D = tf2ss(b, a)\n\nprintln(\"A = \", A, \"\\nB = \", B, \"\\nC = \", C, \"\\nD = \", D)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": "A = [-0.06666666666666668 -0.1111111111111111; 1.0 0.0]\nB = [1.0, 0.0]\nC = [0.0 0.2222222222222222]\nD = [0.0]\n"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Section name",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false,
          "outputInfo": {
            "isExpanded": false,
            "scrollTop": 0
          },
          "maskInfo": {
            "isMaskVisible": true,
            "isEditorVisible": true,
            "isAutoplayActive": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "55391714",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "W = tf(b,a)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
