    {
      "id": "a6c68afc",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Определим коэффициент усиления фильтра Калмана с использованием функции [`kalman`](https://juliacontrol.github.io/ControlSystems.jl/stable/lib/synthesis/#ControlSystemsBase.kalman-Tuple{Any,%20Any,%20Any,%20Any,%20Any,%20Vararg{Any}}) из библиотеки [`ControlSystems.jl`](https://juliacontrol.github.io/ControlSystems.jl/stable/):"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2e4b696d",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "K = kalman(sys, Q, R)"
      ],
      "execution_count": 0,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
